WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.280
ChessKid is fun!

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.320
Chess is great for the brain!

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.990
It's also fun to play!

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.190
And ChessKid makes it easy to have fun!

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.220
Whether your child is a total beginner or a prodigy

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.500
they can hop on and find a well matched opponent

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.150
from around the world at any time.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:15.800
ChessKid is the safe, parent-approved

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.710
way for your child to play chess online.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.500
ChessKid is educational!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.050
To kids, it feels just like playing,

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.160
but chess is a great way to learn patience,

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.660
strategy, and critical thinking.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.789
ChessKid features a comprehensive training program

00:00:28.789 --> 00:00:31.450
that guides kids to level up on their way to mastery.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.179
This curriculum is designed

00:00:33.179 --> 00:00:34.739
to work with Common Core standards

00:00:34.739 --> 00:00:36.500
and global educational guidelines.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.960
There are more than 50,000 chess Puzzles

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.000
and a whole library of entertaining videos

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
that teach strategies, tactics, openings

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.059
and endgames, specifically for kids!

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:47.540
ChessKid is easy!

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.200
Whether you're a parent helping your child,

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.969
a coach managing dozens of kids,

00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:52.929
or a school of hundreds!

00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:53.996
ChessKid helps you organize

00:00:53.996 --> 00:00:56.170
your students and monitor their progress.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.089
Each child receives a weekly report card

00:00:58.089 --> 00:00:59.900
that shows how many Lessons, Puzzles

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.710
and games were completed.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:04.072
You can also organize kids into Clubs

00:01:04.072 --> 00:01:05.540
and send them messages.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.720
ChessKid is the online home of scholastic chess

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:11.300
for thousands of kids, parents, schools, and coaches.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.860
Signing up is free and easy!

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:14.030
So, what are you waiting for?

